  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the toxic district of Subchain City, 'Blight' was a natural survivor. After a DRIP-related accident left him 'bone dry,' he adapted, becoming immune to most toxins and developing a knack for scavenging in the most irradiated zones. He now wanders the outskirts of the ruins, searching for lost tech and rare schematics, with a side hustle as a debt collector.",
    "class": "Toxic Tech Scavenger",
    "name": "Blight",
    "personality": "Cynical and resourceful. Blight doesn't trust easily, hardened by the harsh realities of Subchain City. He's got a dark sense of humor and a knack for finding valuable scrap in the most unlikely places, making him a valuable (if prickly) asset to any flock.",
